    “Processing is done using Databricks with PySpark.
    Created separate databases for:
    MDM
    Media
    Shipment
    Tables are built on top of blob storage paths

    Transformations include:
    Data cleaning
    Schema validation
    Business transformations

    We used Delta Lake features like:
    ACID transactions
    Schema enforcement”

4. Orchestration

    “ADF orchestrates the complete flow:
    Trigger pipeline
    Fetch data via API
    Store in Blob
    Trigger Databricks notebooks
    Load processed data into final tables”

